{"date": "2015-08-21", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2015/0821.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:12:56+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "ddb21b5d8e973d9caa2018f94febc7d1f0ce2b967818b43f8235c9e5ae554c04", "image_bytes": 66613, "last_modified": "Wed, 14 Sep 2016 16:35:26 GMT", "title": "宜一分为二", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "小森林", "author": "森淳一", "author_roles": [], "ocr_confidence_min": 1, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "那天暴风雪与春日的阳光交替而至，令人应接不暇。天空被蓝天和乌云一分力二。和我一样。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
{"date": "2015-08-22", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2015/0822.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:12:57+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "db13acd1a454a17243e5900d982b77246aa8c6eac94fad37eed77777dca801a0", "image_bytes": 75333, "last_modified": "Wed, 14 Sep 2016 12:30:38 GMT", "title": "宜完美", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "地狱一季", "author": "兰波", "author_roles": [], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "以往，如果我没有记错，我的生命曾是一场盛宴。在那里，所有的心灵全都敞开，所有的美酒纷纷溢出来。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "Rimbaud"}
{"date": "2015-08-23", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2015/0823.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:12:57+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "16f255ad0ea937ce5b4e432409e20734593be61b754327cd1cf1a359abe706ff", "image_bytes": 66541, "last_modified": "Wed, 14 Sep 2016 12:30:37 GMT", "title": "宜前行", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "圣女贞德", "author": "萧伯纳", "author_roles": [], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.3, "review_flags": ["low_ocr_confidence"], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "现在让我走吧，黑夜已经在外面等得不耐烦了。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "Bernard Shaw", "author_name_audit": {"date": "2026-11-03", "method": "visual_attribution_crop", "fields": ["author_foreign_name"], "image_sha256": "16f255ad0ea937ce5b4e432409e20734593be61b754327cd1cf1a359abe706ff", "note": "重新对照原图外文署名；保留原图拼写。"}, "metadata_edits": [{"audit": "author_names_2026-11-03", "changes": {"author_foreign_name": {"before": "Detnard Sher", "after": "Bernard Shaw"}}, "evidence_image_sha256": "16f255ad0ea937ce5b4e432409e20734593be61b754327cd1cf1a359abe706ff"}]}
{"date": "2015-08-24", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2015/0824.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:12:57+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "7a2fa97937ccf59a7c55cf10ef0fd5d0a9ec238b8b4a0719e0c3aba8d8cb0f2d", "image_bytes": 55265, "last_modified": "Tue, 13 Sep 2016 09:32:31 GMT", "title": "忌永恒", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "三体", "author": "刘慈欣", "author_roles": [], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "死亡不是你的敌人，永恒才是。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
