{"date": "2015-08-31", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2015/0831.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:12:59+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "a85a1120d7015a6f1919d7865227af162141ec3f7e959449111387af5d6d9610", "image_bytes": 81919, "last_modified": "Wed, 14 Sep 2016 09:00:26 GMT", "title": "忌欺骗", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "人间天堂", "author": "菲茨杰拉德", "author_roles": [], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "夏日不过是春天没有兑现的诺言，是冒充我四月里梦以求的和煦夜晚的骗子。它是没有声息的人生悲苦的季节，它没有节日。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "F.Scott Fitzgerald"}
